msgstr "'{1}' nav ne zināma mape, ne dir ID (zināmās mapes: ProgramFiles, ProgramFiles32, CommonFiles, AppData, LocalAppData, CommonAppData, StartMenu, Programs, Desktop, Windows, System, Fonts, Temp)"

